<div style="padding: 30px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <!-- Status Banner -->
    <div style="background-color: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #92400e; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Under Manual Review</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #78350f; font-size: 14px;">Our verification team is carefully reviewing your credentials</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Greeting -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        Hey <strong>Dr. {{fullName}}</strong>,
    </p>

    <!-- Intro message -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        Your verification request is now under manual review by our specialized verification team. 
        This additional step ensures the highest standards of credential validation.
    </p>

    <!-- Review Process -->
    <div style="background-color: #f0f9ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0c4a6e; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px;">
            Review Process
        </h3>
        <div style="margin: 15px 0;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px; background-color: white; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <span style="background-color: #10b981; color: white; border-radius: 50%; width: 24px; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 12px; font-size: 12px;">✓</span>
                <span style="color: #374151; font-size: 14px;">Initial submission received</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px; background-color: white; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <span style="background-color: #10b981; color: white; border-radius: 50%; width: 24px; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 12px; font-size: 12px;">✓</span>
                <span style="color: #374151; font-size: 14px;">Documents uploaded and processed</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px; background-color: #fef3c7; border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <span style="background-color: #f59e0b; color: white; border-radius: 50%; width: 24px; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 12px; font-size: 12px;">⏳</span>
                <span style="color: #374151; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;">Manual review in progress</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px; background-color: white; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0.6;">
                <span style="background-color: #d1d5db; color: white; border-radius: 50%; width: 24px; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 12px; font-size: 12px;">○</span>
                <span style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">Verification decision</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div style="background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px;">
            Expected Timeline
        </h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 14px;">
            Manual reviews typically take <strong>3-5 business days</strong> to complete. 
            We'll notify you immediately once the review is finished.
        </p>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 13px; font-style: italic;">
            Complex cases may require additional time for thorough verification.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Review details -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        During this review, our team will:
    </p>
    <ul style="color: #374151; margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Verify your medical license with the issuing authority</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Cross-reference your educational credentials</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Validate your professional experience</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Ensure all documentation is authentic and current</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Button -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        {{> button url=dashboardLink text="Check Status" }}
    </div>

    <!-- Support info -->
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; margin: 20px 0;">
        Questions about the review process? <a href="{{supportLink}}" style="color: #272EA7;">Contact our team</a>
    </p>

    <!-- Sign off -->
    <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px;">
        The CosmicForge Health Team
    </p>

</div>